{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 58, :comments ["It is the way of the world thus — that is: even though the Holy One, blessed be He, desired this match, nevertheless they said to her: Will you go with this man, or with another man after some days or a decade, for it is the custom, as we learned: they give a virgin twelve months to prepare herself." "'I will go' — I do not care to delay on account of adorning myself."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:03.516579063Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}